          "explanation": "Yes: concrete, related."
        },
        {
          "id": "b",
          "text": "« Le temps, c'est important. »",
          "explanation": "Too general."
        },
        {
          "id": "c",
          "text": "« J'aime mon bureau. »",
          "explanation": "Unrelated."
        },
        {
          "id": "d",
          "text": "« Beaucoup de gens travaillent. »",
          "explanation": "Unrelated."
        }
      ],
      "answer": "a",
      "stage": "D",
      "hint": "The best example is specific and directly linked."
